      "description": "实际 shadcn 按钮变体，保留悬停、焦点、按下与禁用状态。",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-button-primary\">主操作</button>",
      "css": ".ds-button-primary{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:.5rem;height:2.75rem;padding:0 1rem;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:.75rem;font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;font-size:.875rem;line-height:1.4285714286;font-weight:500;white-space:nowrap;cursor:pointer;transition:all 150ms cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1);background:var(--primary, #fb7299);color:var(--primary-foreground, #351020);}.ds-button-primary:hover{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--primary, #fb7299) 80%,transparent);}.ds-button-primary:focus-visible{outline:none;border-color:var(--ring, #1687b3);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px color-mix(in srgb,var(--ring, #1687b3) 50%,transparent);}.ds-button-primary:active{transform:translateY(1px)}.ds-button-primary:disabled{pointer-events:none;opacity:.5}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-button-primary{transition-duration:0s}}"
    },
    {
