      "refersTo": "tool-index-row",
      "description": "首页和工具页共用的完整链接行。",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-index\" href=\"#\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"11\" width=\"18\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"/></svg><span><strong>密码生成</strong><small>生成随机密码</small></span><svg class=\"ds-index-arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14m-7-7 7 7-7 7\"/></svg></a>",
      "css": ".ds-index{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.875rem;min-height:5.75rem;padding:1.25rem .5rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border, #e3dcd1);border-radius:.25rem;color:var(--foreground, #37312e);font-family:system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;text-decoration:none;transition:background-color 150ms,color 150ms}.ds-index:hover{background:var(--muted, #f3efe8)}.ds-index:active{background:var(--accent, #fce9ee)}.ds-index:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--ring, #1687b3);outline-offset:4px}.ds-index>svg{width:1.25rem;height:1.25rem;flex-shrink:0;color:var(--muted-foreground, #756b60)}.ds-index strong{display:block;font-size:.875rem;font-weight:550}.ds-index small{display:block;margin-top:.375rem;color:var(--muted-foreground, #756b60);font-size:.8125rem;line-height:1.7}.ds-index .ds-index-arrow{width:1rem;height:1rem;margin-left:auto;color:var(--primary, #fb7299)}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-index{transition-duration:0s}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "工资显示开关",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "salary-switch",
      "description": "对应现有 SalarySettings 的双态外观；预览为原生按钮，不接管应用状态。",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-switch\" role=\"switch\" aria-checked=\"true\" aria-label=\"显示工资区\"><span></span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-switch{position:relative;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;width:32px;height:18.4px;padding:0;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:9999px;background:var(--input, #968777);cursor:pointer;transition:all 150ms cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1)}.ds-switch::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:-.5rem -.75rem}.ds-switch[aria-checked=\"true\"]{background:var(--primary, #fb7299)}.ds-switch span{display:block;width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:9999px;background:var(--background, #fcfaf6);transition:transform 150ms cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1)}.ds-switch[aria-checked=\"true\"] span{transform:translateX(calc(100% - 2px))}.ds-switch:focus-visible{outline:none;border-color:var(--ring, #1687b3);box-shadow:0 0 0 3px color-mix(in srgb,var(--ring, #1687b3) 50%,transparent);}.ds-switch:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:not-allowed}:host-context(.dark) .ds-switch[aria-checked=\"true\"] span{background:var(--primary-foreground, #351020)}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-switch{transition-duration:0s}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "日常索引",
    "overview": "暖白纸面、暖墨灰文字、蓝色链接和哔哩粉主操作构成日常索引。暗色采用较亮的暖炭黑分层表面与暖黄文字，保留蓝粉强调。字体、布局、内容与交互保持既有系统。",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "暖色导航与独立工作区。",
      "标题宋体、正文无衬线，数字按需等宽。",
      "索引行共享图标、说明、箭头与定位反馈。",
      "应用页面共享标题、操作区与复制反馈。",
      "细边界、低浮起、完整的深浅主题与键盘状态。"
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Semantic Theme Rule",
        "body": "新增界面使用语义颜色变量；浅深主题共同切换文字、表面、边界与操作色。",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Reading Type Rule",
        "body": "品牌和一级、二级标题使用衬线字体，正文与表单保持无衬线；等宽字体只服务编辑内容和结果。",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Single Surface Rule",
        "body": "编辑与预览共用单层工作表面，以留白和分隔表达内部层级。",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do 使用语义变量，让导航、工作区、焦点与错误反馈随主题一起切换。",
      "Do 保留标题衬线与表单无衬线的分工，长文使用通用 Markdown 排版。",
      "Do 在首页与工具页复用同一种索引行，在手机导航保留直接工具入口。",
      "Do 用真实加载、错误、空内容、复制成功与禁用状态解释当前操作。"
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't 根据业务标题、段落位置或列表顺序给 API Markdown 硬拆版式。",
      "Don't 为视觉效果编造工资、倒计时、工具结果或进度数值。",
      "Don't 给分享预览额外嵌套第二层卡片。",
      "Don't 将单页遗留阈值色、方向草图或未实现的状态提升为全局规范。"
    ]
  }
}
